# Dataset

This project uses the Olist Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset.

The original dataset contains multiple CSV files, including orders, customers, products, payments and reviews.

Due to the dataset's large size, the original CSV files are not included in this repository.

**Dataset source:** [Olist Brazilian E-Commerce Dataset – Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/olistbr/brazilian-ecommerce)
